  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 800eb (Very Expensive)  <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons compatible with Range Table Modification or Melee Range Modification</p>\n<p><em>Long, snub, medium? Why choose! With nano-motors from the Euro-block, changing lengths has never been easier.</em></p>\n<p>Only one Telescopic Barrel may be installed at a time. The weapon is now capable of accepting up to two Range Table Modifications (IRV5, pg. 112) or two Melee Range Modifications for which the weapon is already eligible for. Only one installed Range Table or Melee Range Modification may be active at a time. Swapping between installed Range Table Modifications requires no Check and takes 1 minute. Incompatible with Gatling Barrel and Heavy Barrel.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Barrels &amp; Muzzles).</em></p>"
